{"id":"achat","lemma":"achat","pos":"noun","rank":3974,"glosses":["buy, purchase"],"ipa":"/a.ʃa/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ec/Fr-achat.ogg/Fr-achat.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"achats"},"formAudio":{"achats":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-achats.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Merci pour votre achat.","en":"Thank you for your purchase.","words":[{"g":"thank you"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null]},{"text":"Elle adore faire des achats.","en":"She loves shopping.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to love, to adore","l":"adorer"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Cet achat a été une bonne affaire.","en":"That purchase was a good bargain.","words":[{"g":"this"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"},{"g":"business"}]},{"text":"Voulez-vous venir faire des achats avec moi ?","en":"Do you want to go shopping with me?","words":[{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to come"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Nous avons beaucoup d'achats à faire.","en":"We have many purchases to make.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to do"}]}]}